# URL of the Spring Boot backend. Leave empty in development (Vite proxies /api to localhost:8080).
# In production (Vercel), set it to your Render URL, e.g. https://portfolio-api.onrender.com
# Named VITE_API_URL_PORTFOLIO because Vercel rejected plain VITE_API_URL on this project
# (the code also accepts VITE_API_URL as a fallback on other hosts).
VITE_API_URL_PORTFOLIO=
